=2 Boss Fight
[Area
{z:La'Loff Amphitheater} - HP #1
>Boss
{m:Ark Angel HM} (WAR/NIN)
>Abilities
* Can use {p:Mighty Strikes} and {p:Mijin Gakure}.
* Uses the unique WS **Cross Reaver** which does cone damage (~500-900) and has an additional effect of {p:Stun|Stun (Status)}.

>Notes
* The biggest single fear in this fight is {p:Mijin Gakure}, which can easily spell a wipe if used at high HP. Magic Mitigation such as {p:Rampart}, {p:Shell}, {p:Fealty}, and any other damage mitigation spells/Blood Pacts will help keep you alive; but it is non-elemental damage, so {p:Bar spells|Bar spell} have no effect. Beyond that, simply survive and defeat him.

----
{z:La'Loff Amphitheater} - HP #2
>Boss
{m:Ark Angel TT} (BLM/DRK)
>Abilities
* Uses the unique WS **Amon Drive** which does AoE damage (~100-300) and has an additional effect of {p:Paralysis} and {p:Petrification}. Absorbed by {p:Utsusemi}.
* Can use {p:Manafont} and {p:Blood Weapon}.
* Will teleport around the arena.

>Notes
* Just fight him normally, try to stay out of range of the AoE.

----
{z:La'Loff Amphitheater} - HP #3
>Boss
{m:Ark Angel MR} (THF/BST)
>Abilities
* Can use {p:Perfect Dodge} and {p:Charm}.
* Uses the unique WS **Havoc Spiral** which does AoE damage (~100-300) and has an additional effect of {p:Sleep|Sleep (Status)}. Absorbed by {p:Utsusemi}.
* Can Charm your tank regardless of whether or not her pet is still alive, so plan accordingly.

>Notes
* Will summon a pet, usually a tiger, but can be a Mandragora as well. Sleep the pet and ignore it.

----
{z:La'Loff Amphitheater} - HP #4
>Boss
{m:Ark Angel EV} (PLD/WHM)
>Abilities
* Can use {p:Invincible} and {p:Benediction}.
* Uses the unique WS **Dominion Slash** which does AoE damage (~100-300) and has an additional effect of {p:Silence|Silence (Status)}. Absorbed by {p:Utsusemi}. Recommended to bring {i:Echo Drops|Echo Drops|4151}. It can also dispel buffs.
* Uses the unique ability **Shield Strike** which is a cone attack that does ~100 damage and {p:Stun|Stun (Status)}.

>Notes
* Take care to avoid {p:Spirits Within}, as it can easily destroy your tank. {s:Gravity} and {s:Bind} and kite the NM is typically the best strategy.
* Surprisingly strong to fight around era level (75-80ish) when soloing with Trusts due to the AOE damage and status effects going out as Trust WHM's burn a lot of MP erasing and na-ing the whole party
* If soloing with Trusts on a brand new account -- your first Job to 99 -- you may wish to wait until you are 85+ or request help from someone to blow past this specific NM
* Wiped 2x as a 78 WAR/SAM with Perle set from Abyssea on, and with trusts Valaineral, Ayame, Semih Lafihna, and Yoran-Oran (UC)

----
{z:La'Loff Amphitheater} - HP #5
>Boss
{m:Ark Angel GK} (SAM/DRG)
>Abilities
* Can use {p:Call Wyvern} and {p:Meikyo Shisui} multiple times.
* Uses the unique WS **Dragonfall** which does AoE damage (~100-300) and has an additional effect of {p:Bind|Bind (Status)}. Absorbed by {p:Utsusemi}.

>Notes
* Straight fight, NIN tank suggested to reduce WS damage from Meikyo Shisui.

